        "accordion_block_1_1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does Warranty Cover?",
            "text": "<h6>Warranty Coverage</h6><p>Koozi Pets provides a <strong>12-month limited warranty</strong> covering manufacturing defects only. This warranty applies solely to defects from faulty workmanship.<br/><br/>The warranty period for Crates purchased from Koozi is one (1) year from the date of purchase. If a replacement Crate or part is provided, it will inherit the remaining warranty of the original item or one year from the replacement date.</p><p>During the warranty period, Koozi Pets will replace any products or parts of the crate that are proven to be defective due to improper material or workmanship, only. Repairs and/or replacements are provided at no charge to you, for eligible warranty claims.</p><h4></h4>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_block_1_2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is excluded from warranty?",
            "text": "<h6>Warranty Exclusions</h6><p>The warranty does <strong>not</strong> cover:</p><ul><li><strong>Damage caused by improper assembly </strong>or not following the instructions when unpacking. </li><li><strong>Normal wear and tear</strong>, including any dog-related use, washing-related wear, weathering, sun-damage or corrosion.</li><li><strong>Damages due to use by pets</strong> (e.g., chewing, bites, rips, burns, excessive scratching, stains, or moisture/liquid damage).</li><li><strong>Damage from improper weight placement</strong> on the crate.</li><li><strong>Scars, marks and colour</strong> that are characteristics of natural materials;</li><li><strong>Damage caused by spills </strong>such as acid, solvents, dyes or other corrosive materials, ink, paint, or bodily flui</li><li><strong>Commercial use</strong> damage, such as use in hotels or stores.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_block_1_3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I make a warranty claim?",
            "text": "<p>Upon receiving your Koozi Side Table Crate, or, after assembling it, please inspect it carefully.<br/><br/>If you notice any defect or damage contact us promptly at <a><strong>help@koozipets.com.au</strong></a>. <br/><br/>Include in the email: </p><ul><li>Clear photos</li><li>Detailed description of the issue</li><li>Your order number </li><li>Your contact details<br/></li></ul><p>We’ll evaluate and address the issue with either a replacement or repair.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_block_1_4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Returns and Exchanges Policy",
            "text": "<p><strong>We do not offer returns or exchanges</strong> on the Side Table Crate for change of mind, as it is a<em> large furniture item</em> and cannot be returned back to us once shipped. <br/><br/>Before purchasing, please ensure the crate meets your dog’s size and  has that you have an adequate space in your home to fit it. </p>"
